  triage:title "boundaries/atm-storage-rusqlite/task-store-sqlite.toml not updated for the three escalation-recipient methods" ;
  triage:description "AX.6 QA-1 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R1-1788626395, PR #1204 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T16:56Z) at head 490a6c42a0f3283c251875d9a61fcf99b641c2a2. The sqlite companion boundary record is out of sync with the shipped TaskStore surface: its sibling boundaries/atm-storage/task-store.toml gained EscalationScope, the response types and the D8 note, but task-store-sqlite.toml did not. Also raised by ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F002. fenix ruling: task-store-sqlite.toml may gain ONLY what the three methods list_escalation_recipients/add_escalation_recipient/remove_escalation_recipient strictly require (request type EscalationScope, their response types, the D8 note), mirroring the sibling; nothing else in the file may change." ;
